# Ad-hoc inspection / sampling scripts + their outputs in the repo root —
# written per-investigation to read Gist state, sample emails by X-GM-MSGID,
# diff matcher output, or hold one-shot paste artifacts (e.g. the watchlist
# Doc paste-back from scripts/remove_watchlist_urls.py). Disposable; not
# part of the codebase.
/_*

# Internal dev notes / agent handoffs — kept locally, never shared. These hold
# personal references (working notes, process, examples) and aren't needed by
# anyone using the project. Untracked via `git rm --cached`; the files stay on
# disk. NOT root-anchored, so a handoff doc in any subdir is ignored too.
CLAUDE.md
TESTING_NEEDED.md
HANDOFF_*.md
BUILD_PLAN.md

# Real-data / state dumps — the Gist holds all the real wardrobe/price/code/etc.
# data; never let a local inspection copy of a Gist state file get staged. These
# names are root-anchored (the synthetic test fixtures live under tests/fixtures/
# with prefixed names like aniqi_trafalgar.json, so they're unaffected).
/wardrobe.json
/prices.json
/codes.json
/shop_aliases.json
/email_sales.json
/fx_rates.json
/gmail_state.json
/voice_state.json
/sms_aliases.json
/signup_state.json
/body_scans.json
/shop_verdicts.json
/restock_state.json
# Raw captured emails / state dumps saved to the repo root for inspection.
/*.eml
/*_dump.json
/.pii-denylist
